0..83 Comment "//! `derive-eq-over-codes` models generic equality from levitated declaration code."
84..87 Comment "//!"
88..160 Comment "//! `Nat` and `Tagged` give closed codes that `Eq.generic` can traverse."
161..238 Comment "//! The pathological twin refuses parameterized and mutually recursive codes."
239..242 Comment "//!"
243..317 Comment "//! The checker lowers the traversal to closed core and judges the result."
318..364 Comment "//! The kernel replays the checked derivation."
365..368 Comment "//!"
369..418 Comment "//! - cites: [Chapman-2010-gentle_art_levitation]"
419..422 Comment "//!"
